      "id": "claim_ffaba70ef24a4a1cb58d456f738e8296",
      "statement": "The zod annotationDefSchema is a recursive strict object whose superRefine enforces cross-field rules: max>=min, a node must have a type or non-empty children, options only on a string field, and required only on a field; projectSchema's superRefine requires a non-empty config.schema and a non-empty pdf on every paper, both relaxed when config.screening is present.",
      "evidence": [
