      "statement": "ScreeningConfig is the one authorable screening setting (reasons: string[], non-empty, trimmed/deduped by project.ts); its presence under config makes a project a screening project, config.schema is then ignored on load and rewritten on save as the derived screeningSchemaDefs projection — a fixed two-field schema of Decision (Include/Exclude enum) and Reason (enum of the reasons).",
