      "statement": "completeness(defs, tree) computes filled/total for the paper-list dot: the denominator is required fields only when the schema marks anything required (so the dot and the Validate dialog never disagree), otherwise every field; booleans are excluded from both sides; repeatable nodes are counted per instance actually present in the tree; and visibleIf-hidden fields are skipped entirely exactly as validate.ts skips them.",
