      "statement": "countPapersUsingField(papers, path) counts how many papers record a real answer at exactly a field's root-down path across the consolidated tree and every reviewer's own, matching by path (not bare name, to avoid crying wolf on a half-typed field) and using isAnswer which mirrors the shared emptiness rule (an unticked boolean and a blank string are not answers); SchemaTreeEditor.tsx uses it to warn before a rename/remove/move that would orphan answers.",
