      "statement": "countLinksUsingField is the counterpart of countPapersUsingField for a PDF-mark 'why I picked this value' link; unlike an ordinary answer (pruned silently on the next load), an orphaned link leaves the mark still showing a label for a field that no longer resolves with no way for a reviewer to discover it, so it is worth warning about; the linked-field canonical path is parsed via parsePath rather than string-prefix-matched because names containing / or [ are escaped.",
