      "id": "claim_0fbce014b1c4487b82245d765aec3525",
      "statement": "classifyImport(existing, incoming) returns one DupVerdict per incoming record by comparing each against every existing record and every earlier incoming entry, picking the best candidate by rank (DOI-certain > title-certain > probable-by-score); a DOI-certain match short-circuits the search because nothing beats it.",
