      "id": "claim_5f1a4cbfae66443488d51d52b86ef2d9",
      "statement": "A year gap >= 2 (YEAR_GAP_VETO) on an otherwise title-matching pair downgrades the match to 'new' (a workshop paper and its journal extension share a title and are both worth citing); it is >= not !== because databases disagree by one year constantly (online-first vs issue date), which is far more common routine noise than the workshop/journal false positive.",
