      "statement": "Duplicate detection is O(existing x incoming) and runs synchronously in the store's set; fuzzyScoreAtLeast brings the provably-identical result from over 40s of UI freeze to under a second by proving most pairs cannot reach the threshold before computing Levenshtein, using sound lower bounds (length bound and histogram bound, cheapest first) and only calling the shared stringSimilarity when neither rules the pair out.",
